        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Eden ramgai khou tei lung khang",
            "Guang nimei tingmik na guang the;",
            "Panty luaina tat pui nung kiu,",
            "Guang tang puni kaukai dai khou.",
            "",
            "Alung ning le abumaeng hei,",
            "Tingkau ram khou ruan na tat bam;",
            "Nban ram khou hei lung nimak ge,",
            "Tat kandi kho nzianmei nun le.",
            "",
            "2. Mang thang hougai mei suang e,",
            "Lauziuna rui gaan na bam e;",
            "Mang maan ritho kagan mak khe,",
            "Zaipat louni pou khrista rui.",
            "",
            "3. Kau ramvgay tang mak khang lung geic;",
            "Zingmei muang rui gumliam bam e;",
            "Gaanc guang dat ro kanloumeipu,",
            "Ringmei thinglimh khou zaeng sw ni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
